Run the following in terminal
1. pip install -r requirements.txt

2. python seed_prompts.py
   -> uploads the agent prompts to Langfuse Prompt Management

3. python orchestrator.py
   -> runs the Saga on paper.pdf, evaluates it, prints the Langfuse trace URL
   Options: python orchestrator.py paper1.pdf --model gpt-4o-mini
            python orchestrator.py --simulate-failure   (rollback demo)
            python orchestrator.py --no-ragas           (custom evaluators only)

4. python experiment.py
   -> runs all papers as a Langfuse dataset run; repeat with another
      --model or prompt version and compare runs under Datasets -> research-papers

5. streamlit run app.py
   -> upload a paper and view the three agents' results, scores and trace link
